## Why This Is Asked
This question probes end-to-end thinking on governance, data lineage, and drift in a multi-tenant Azure OpenAI deployment.

## Key Concepts
- Multi-tenant policy enforcement and data residency
- Drift detection across prompts and retrieved knowledge
- Data lineage with Azure Purview and observability with Azure Monitor
- PII redaction before OpenAI calls and grounding with Cognitive Search

## Code Example
```javascript
function redactPII(text){
  // naive: redact an email-like token if present
  if (text.indexOf('@') >= 0) {
    const at = text.indexOf('@')
    const left = text.substring(0, at)
    return left + '[REDACTED_EMAIL]'
  }
  return text
}
```

